    "text": "Two simple harmonic motions are represented by the equation $\\mathrm{y}_1=0.1$ $\\sin \\left(100 \\pi t+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$ and $y_2=0.1 \\cos \\pi t$. The phase difference of the velocity of particle 1 w.r.t. the velocity of the particle 2 is"
  },
